@startuml
[*] --> Idle : Initial State
Idle --> Added : User adds new goods
Added --> Updated : User updates price of existing item
Updated --> Removed : Goods are no longer required
Removed --> Expired : Goods expire
Expired --> Removed : Notify user for removal
Added --> Ordered : User places order for additional goods
Ordered --> Purchased : Order is placed successfully
Purchased --> Billing : Customer is being billed
Billing --> Idle : Transaction completed
Purchased --> Removed : Items are removed from inventory
Billing --> Removed : Cancelled transaction, items removed

[*] --> Added : Initial State (alternative)
Added --> Ordered : User places order for additional goods (alternative)

[*] --> Purchased : User selects items for purchase
Purchased --> Billing : Customer is being billed

[*] --> Removed : Goods are no longer required
Removed --> Expired : Goods expire

[*] --> Ordered : User places order for additional goods
Ordered --> Purchased : Order is placed successfully

[*] --> Billing : Transaction completed
Billing --> Idle : Final State

[*] --> Removed : Cancelled transaction, items removed
@enduml
